	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c03p17_swchampion_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>アイリス『あちら　からね
げすいどうに　はいれるんだよ！▼
どう？
あやしい　かんじが　するでしょ？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-15T03:55:14" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:10" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>アイリス『あちら　からね
下水道に　入れるんだよ！▼
どう？
怪しい　感じが　するでしょ？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-15T03:55:21" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:10" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀
・c03p07→c03でのイベント後
・続けてswrival_01</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-11T09:47:49" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWCHAMPION
アイリス</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-17T03:07:41" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
